WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:02.500
- All right, everybody we've
reached the end of the hour,

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.160
but we have time for one more
story that may make you happy.

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:06.699
This is "What I'm Liking."

00:00:06.699 --> 00:00:09.532
(audience cheers)

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:12.200
So if you know me at all, you know

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:16.320
I'm a huge sports ball fanatic,
but this is really cool.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:19.096
Tomorrow actually does
mark the 75th anniversary

00:00:19.096 --> 00:00:21.700
of Jackie Robinson
breaking the color barrier

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:23.383
for Major League Baseball.

00:00:23.383 --> 00:00:25.350
(audience cheers)

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:28.100
- It happened on April 15th, 1947,

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:30.230
when he took the field
as the first baseman

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:31.810
for the Brooklyn Dodgers.

00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:34.670
75 years later, y'all,
the Los Angeles Dodgers,

00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:36.600
as well as the entire league,

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:39.030
are honoring number 42 in a huge way.

00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:40.870
Here to talk about it is the manager

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:42.300
for the Dodgers, Dave Roberts,

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:44.677
who watches on NBC Four, Los Angeles.

00:00:45.587 --> 00:00:46.420
- What's up Dave?

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:48.988
(audience cheers)

00:00:48.988 --> 00:00:49.821
What's up Dave?

00:00:49.821 --> 00:00:52.470
So Jackie Robinson's
legacy is still a big part

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:54.364
of baseball and the
Dodgers as well, right?

00:00:54.364 --> 00:00:56.100
- It is, Kelly.

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:59.610
And thank you so much for
having me join you guys.

00:00:59.610 --> 00:01:04.610
And I remember when
Jackie Robinson, talking

00:01:05.030 --> 00:01:09.570
to Sharon Robinson and
being a ball player,

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:13.290
former ball player, every single day now,

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:14.910
Jackie Robinson Day.

00:01:14.910 --> 00:01:17.020
Every player wears number 42

00:01:17.020 --> 00:01:18.810
to commemorate Jackie Robinson.

00:01:18.810 --> 00:01:19.643
And I'll tell you this,

00:01:19.643 --> 00:01:23.300
that the great Dr. Martin Luther King said

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:26.760
he would not have been
able to do what he did

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:30.229
for civil rights if it
weren't for Jackie Robinson.

00:01:30.229 --> 00:01:31.062
(audience cheers)

00:01:31.062 --> 00:01:32.873
So I'm a big legacy guy, and
no one has a bigger legacy

00:01:32.873 --> 00:01:34.440
than Jackie.

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:35.350
- That's amazing.

00:01:35.350 --> 00:01:36.183
And what a cool honor.

00:01:36.183 --> 00:01:38.930
So how are y'all gonna
be honoring him tomorrow?

00:01:38.930 --> 00:01:40.540
- So it's, I'm excited.

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:43.552
I mean, for me to be able
to, I'm a former Bruin,

00:01:43.552 --> 00:01:46.270
and I played at Jackie Robinson Stadium.

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:49.640
So tomorrow night at
Dodger Stadium at 7:10,

00:01:49.640 --> 00:01:53.228
the first 40,000 fans are gonna get a

00:01:53.228 --> 00:01:56.730
75th anniversary commemorative jersey,

00:01:56.730 --> 00:01:58.171
Jackie Robinson.

00:01:58.171 --> 00:01:59.004
- Wow.

00:01:59.004 --> 00:02:01.580
- 42 jersey, which is gonna be so special.

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:04.470
So they're gonna be rocking 42 jerseys all

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:05.350
over Dodger stadium.

00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:07.300
And also, the Dodger,

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:09.660
Jackie Robinson Scholar
Foundation is gonna

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:12.040
bring 75 people, Kelly.

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:17.040
42 people that have kind of
gone through that system,

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:20.210
and 33 young kids that are still

00:02:20.210 --> 00:02:21.800
at John Muir High School,

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:23.320
that are still part of that program.

00:02:23.320 --> 00:02:26.370
So the Dodgers, the Jackie
Robinson Foundation,

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:30.130
do so much, Kelly, in the
community, for the kids.

00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:31.720
And that's me right there.

00:02:31.720 --> 00:02:34.780
I had all of our players do the unveiling

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:35.940
of Jackie Robinson.

00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:37.840
And it was more of just talking

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:41.390
to guys that, we wear this Dodger jersey

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:43.440
but that's the OG, the person,

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:46.010
and what Jackie Robinson stood for.

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:48.190
And I think that when
you're a better player,

00:02:48.190 --> 00:02:50.750
you understand and appreciate the guys,

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:53.700
the people that came before
us, it just makes us better.

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:56.797
And no one exuded that more than Jackie.

00:02:56.797 --> 00:02:57.630
(audience cheers)

00:02:57.630 --> 00:02:59.357
- That's amazing.

00:02:59.357 --> 00:03:01.450
Thank you so much, Dave.

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:03.677
- I'm liking the post right now.

00:03:05.470 --> 00:03:06.750
That's not all, everybody.

00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:09.330
Our season-long partner,
Pilot Pen, makers of Frixion,

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:11.500
the go-to erasable pen, of
the Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:13.670
want to celebrate those
creating fearlessly,

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:15.210
just like Jackie Robinson did.

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:17.410
So they're gonna donate a thousand dollars

00:03:17.410 --> 00:03:19.183
to the Jackie Robinson Foundation.

00:03:19.183 --> 00:03:20.450
(audience cheers)

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:22.333
- Thank you for joining us, Dave.

00:03:23.267 --> 00:03:24.417
I'll see you at a game.

